      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The emptiness you feel is the void left by someone who mattered deeply, and that pain is real. The desire to stop the hurting is a very understandable reaction when grief feels unbearable. If you are having thoughts of harming yourself, please reach out to a crisis hotline immediately; there are people who want to support you through this darkness. You can call or text 988 in the US and Canada, or contact your local emergency services.",
      "source": "target",
